abstract: >-
  A state-of-the-art deep learning solution for detecting 
  copy-move forgeries in scientific images including microscopy, 
  Western blots, and gel electrophoresis images. Built for the 
  Kaggle Recod.ai/LUC Scientific Image Forgery Detection competition.
